        "textualBasisJa": "The elders of Gilead said to Jephthah, “The LORD will be witness between us. Surely we will do what you say.”"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JDG11:11",
        "textualBasisJa": "Then Jephthah went with the elders of Gilead, and the people made him head and chief over them. Jephthah spoke all his words before the LORD in Mizpah."
      },
      {
        "ref": "JDG11:12",
        "textualBasisJa": "Jephthah sent messengers to the king of the children of Ammon, saying, “What do you have to do with me, that you have come to me to fight against my land?”"
