        "textualBasisJa": "The king of the children of Ammon answered the messengers of Jephthah, “Because Israel took away my land when he came up out of Egypt, from the Arnon even to the Jabbok, and to the Jordan. Now therefore restore that territory again peaceably.”"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JDG11:14",
        "textualBasisJa": "Jephthah sent messengers again to the king of the children of Ammon;"
      },
      {
